# SExtractor config — mission-generic χ²₊ detection image, COLD pass.
# (Used for JWST 4-band, Euclid VIS+NISP, and HST F814W N=1 stacks;
# PIXEL_SCALE / SEEING_FWHM / file names overridden on the command line
# by 51_step3a_chi2_detect.py.)
#
# Adopts Shuntov+ 2025 (COSMOS2025 / COSMOS-Web galaxy catalog,
# A&A 2025) parameters where specified, with CANDELS Galametz+ 2013
# (ApJS 207, 24) values filling unspecified entries.  Heavy smoothing
# + large background mesh + low deblending → detects bright, extended
# galaxies cleanly without shredding them into substructures.
#
# Input image is the χ₊ stack of the mission's bands — each band
# PSF-homogenized to the broadest band, noise-equalized (×√WHT or
# /σ_robust), negatives truncated to zero, then sqrt(mean of squares)
# (the Szalay+99 / SWarp-CHI2 chi form; detection on the SQUARED image
# is unstable, see 51_ docstring).
#
# Output: cold catalog FITS_LDAC + cold segmentation map.

#-------------------------------- Catalog ------------------------------------
CATALOG_TYPE     FITS_LDAC
PARAMETERS_NAME  chi2_detect.param      # detection columns + KRON_RADIUS

#------------------------------- Extraction ----------------------------------
DETECT_TYPE      CCD
DETECT_MINAREA   15                     # Shuntov 2025
DETECT_THRESH    4.0                    # 4σ on χ²+ image, Shuntov 2025
ANALYSIS_THRESH  5.0                    # CANDELS Galametz 2013
FILTER           Y
FILTER_NAME      tophat_9.0_9x9.conv    # Shuntov + CANDELS — heavy smoothing
DEBLEND_NTHRESH  64                     # Shuntov 2025
DEBLEND_MINCONT  0.001                  # Shuntov 2025
CLEAN            Y
CLEAN_PARAM      2.0                    # Shuntov 2025
MASK_TYPE        CORRECT

#------------------------------ Weighting ------------------------------------
WEIGHT_TYPE      NONE                   # χ² image is already noise-normalized
WEIGHT_GAIN      N

#------------------------------ Photometry -----------------------------------
# χ² image is unitless; ZP is irrelevant for the detection catalog.
PHOT_APERTURES   10,17,33
PHOT_AUTOPARAMS  2.5,3.5
PHOT_PETROPARAMS 2.0,3.5
SATUR_LEVEL      1.0e9
MAG_ZEROPOINT    30.0                   # nominal — for sorting only
MAG_GAMMA        4.0
GAIN             0.0
PIXEL_SCALE      0.030

#------------------------- Star/Galaxy Separation ----------------------------
SEEING_FWHM      0.145                  # F444W broad PSF (target of homog.)
STARNNW_NAME     default.nnw

#------------------------------ Background -----------------------------------
BACK_SIZE        256                    # CANDELS Galametz 2013 — large mesh
BACK_FILTERSIZE  9                      # CANDELS
BACKPHOTO_TYPE   LOCAL
BACKPHOTO_THICK  100                    # CANDELS

#------------------------------ Check images ---------------------------------
CHECKIMAGE_TYPE  SEGMENTATION           # cold segmentation drives the merge
CHECKIMAGE_NAME  seg_cold.fits

#--------------------- Memory ------------------------------------------------
MEMORY_OBJSTACK  10000
MEMORY_PIXSTACK  2000000
MEMORY_BUFSIZE   4096

#----------------------------- Miscellaneous ---------------------------------
VERBOSE_TYPE     NORMAL
WRITE_XML        N
NTHREADS         0
